 go and  be there safdi's goal with the  innovative building was to bring green  space and fresh air to the urban  environment an idea he since applied  around the world  i think the whole idea of sustainability  and climate change i think we're  beginning to understand that as we get  urbanized we better not forget how to  humanize a collection safdi hopes will  inspire students and the general public  for generations to come dan specter  global news montreal  what a gift to future architects and  that's global national for tuesday night  i'm farin asser on behalf of our whole  crew i want to thank you so much for  spending part of your evening with us  tonight's your canada is birds hill  provincial park near winnipeg until  tomorrow take care of yourselves and  each other good night  [Music]  you
 

